flowchart TD
  A[Read Session Binding] --> B[Verify exact RC.2 baseline]
  B --> C{Generation asset exists?}
  C -- no --> Q[QUARANTINED]
  C -- yes --> D[Verify manifest and capability fingerprint]
  D --> E{Current generation?}
